{"number":102,"name":"سُورَةُ التَّكَاثُرِ","englishName":"At-Takaathur","englishNameTranslation":"Competition","numberOfAyahs":8,"items":[{"id":"q:102:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":1,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","bn":"প্রাচুর্যের লালসা তোমাদেরকে গাফেল রাখে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/1"},{"id":"q:102:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":2,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","en":"Until you visit the graveyards.","bn":"এমনকি, তোমরা কবরস্থানে পৌছে যাও।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/2"},{"id":"q:102:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":3,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"No! You are going to know.","bn":"এটা কখনও উচিত নয়। তোমরা সত্ত্বরই জেনে নেবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/3"},{"id":"q:102:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":4,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"Then no! You are going to know.","bn":"অতঃপর এটা কখনও উচিত নয়। তোমরা সত্ত্বরই জেনে নেবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/4"},{"id":"q:102:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":5,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","bn":"কখনই নয়; যদি তোমরা নিশ্চিত জানতে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/5"},{"id":"q:102:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":6,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","en":"You will surely see the Hellfire.","bn":"তোমরা অবশ্যই জাহান্নাম দেখবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/6"},{"id":"q:102:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":7,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","bn":"অতঃপর তোমরা তা অবশ্যই দেখবে দিব্য প্রত্যয়ে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/7"},{"id":"q:102:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":102,"ayah":8,"surahName":"At-Takaathur","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","bn":"এরপর অবশ্যই সেদিন তোমরা নেয়ামত সম্পর্কে জিজ্ঞাসিত হবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/102/8"}]}